This plugin orchestrates and depends on third-party software/services that
are NOT redistributed in this repository — consumers provide or connect to
these themselves:

  * Hypernode Brancher API (Hypernode B.V.)
    Consumer-provided Hypernode account + API token. No Hypernode source
    code is bundled in this repository; this plugin is an independent
    client speaking to the public Hypernode REST API
    (https://api.hypernode.com/v2/).
    https://www.hypernode.com/

  * System `ssh`, `scp`, `rsync` binaries
    Used to reach Brancher preview nodes over the consumer's own local SSH
    agent/key. Not bundled — the plugin shells out to whatever is already
    installed on the host. The plugin never holds or stores key material.

  * MCP Python SDK (`mcp`), `httpx`, `pydantic` / `pydantic-settings`
    Installed as ordinary PyPI dependencies via `pyproject.toml` /
    `uv.lock`, not vendored into this repository. See their respective
    upstream licenses for terms.

See README.md for installation and configuration detail.
